{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687250/extras/0122-0173.gif?t=1746972612\" />Fast, Fun, Cheap. Dodge incoming squares that respond to music. Each square is assigned to a specific audio spectrum, e.g center square responds to drums. Game contains 1 hour of epic music generated by AI. Check youtube channel for all music. Government mandated maid hologram will accompany you and encourage you to play more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Game best played by maximizing the epilepsy slider (hence game name). It increases flickering of lights. Gameplay videos are made with maximum epilepsy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can put your own songs into &quot;indistractable_Data\\Player Music&quot; folder. Mind that game will freeze a bit on game start while decompressing your songs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>Controls</u>:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A or D to select game mode in Main Screen</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">WASD or arrow keys for movement</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Space for skipping song</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">ESC to return to menu</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you want controller support, tell me which type you want. Adding PS5 and Playstation controllers are different works. I will try to add the more popular one.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3687250?t=1746972612","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3687250?t=1746972612","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687250/ebbdc71cd4f2de957c7072d1fbd6d75ea4ed7a18/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746972612","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687250/ebbdc71cd4f2de957c7072d1fbd6d75ea4ed7a18/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746972612","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687250/extras/0122-0173.gif?t=1746972612\" />Fast, Fun, Cheap. Dodge incoming squares that respond to music. Each square is assigned to a specific audio spectrum, e.g center square responds to drums. Game contains 1 hour of epic music generated by AI. Check youtube channel for all music. Government mandated maid hologram will accompany you and encourage you to play more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Game best played by maximizing the epilepsy slider (hence game name). It increases flickering of lights. Gameplay videos are made with maximum epilepsy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can put your own songs into &quot;indistractable_Data\\Player Music&quot; folder. Mind that game will freeze a bit on game start while decompressing your songs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>Controls</u>:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A or D to select game mode in Main Screen</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">WASD or arrow keys for movement</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Space for skipping song</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">ESC to return to menu</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you want controller support, tell me which type you want. Adding PS5 and Playstation controllers are different works. I will try to add the more popular one.</p>","developers":["Epileptic Spectrum"],"dlc":[3704830],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687250/a68e533fb415383932c69e2c74759a91247865bc/header.jpg?t=1746972612","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"min